Description: offline audio player and music library manager
 Helikodu plays and organizes your own music library, kept on your own
 computer. It works entirely offline: it never connects to the internet
 and sends no telemetry.
 .
 It plays practically every audio format through FFmpeg, plus tracker
 modules, game music, SID tunes and MIDI files, with gapless playback,
 loudness normalization, smart playlists, lyrics and a play history.
 Output goes to PipeWire, PulseAudio, ALSA or JACK.
 .
 The package contains the desktop application (helikodu), the
 command-line tool (helikodu-cli) and the offline user guide.
